          "text": "# Assessment A — Design + Copy Review\n**Source:** `/tmp/af_critique_bundle.md` (bundle only — no detector, no live DOM)\n**Critique target:** The Armchair Futurist landing page — 16 sections + embedded 9-question AI-readiness assessment\n**Lens:** Award-winning design director; HP white-paper design system; direct/warm/expert voice; \"exit as goal\" product thesis.\n\n---\n\n## 1. DESIGN-SPECIFICITY VERDICT\n\nThe page reads like a real person wrote it for a real offer, not a template. Voice and copy are **Grounded**: the anti-sell honesty is specific and rare — `WhatThisIsNotSection.tsx` (\"I'd rather lose a sale than take on work I can't deliver.\"), `CaseStudiesSection.tsx` (\"Three recent projects. Anonymized and composited. No strategy decks.\"), `KeyStatsSection.tsx` (\"Names of recent clients withheld by request.\"), `ConnectSection.tsx` (\"15 minutes. No pitch. Just clarity.\"). The single-signal-color discipline (`hp-electric` on CTAs, dark `hp-deep` slabs for `AboutMeSection`, `AssessmentCtaSection`, `Footer.tsx`) holds, and decorative chevrons stay at 0.04–0.10 opacity — restrained, not slop.\n\nWhat pulls it back to **Partially Grounded** is structural, not verbal: four named anti-references are present in the layout itself. `LogoBannerSection.tsx` (\"Select engagements\" + grayscale `opacity-50` marquee logos, `[--duration:50s]`) is a textbook logo wall. `MentoringSection.tsx` runs a **4-tier pricing grid** (\"Single / 5-pack / 10-pack / 20-pack\") plus an expandable \"Side-by-side feature comparison\" — the 3-tier-pricing-middle-highlighted / course-platform anti-pattern, just with four tiers. `ROICalculatorSection.tsx` is an interactive SaaS-style estimator with team-size stepper. `KeyStatsSection.tsx` uses `text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black` hero numerals (\"40+\", \"hundreds of hours\", \"10–20 hrs/week\") — the metric-card anti-reference. Copy is distinctive; the *container shapes* are not.\n\n**Verdict: Partially Grounded** (voice = grounded; section architecture... [truncated]",
